  "facts": [
    "The Power P.E.K.K.A (formerly Super P.E.K.K.A) is a troop available in the Clan Capital, available when the Power P.E.K.K.A Barracks is constructed (this requires a level 2 District Hall in the Builder's Workshop district, and hence requires the Capital Hall to be upgraded to level 6)."
